/ DuckDB's browser build loads on its first use, into the running session (the harness checks no /duckdb/ request
/ before this file, some after, and the json extension from the pinned directory).
q)g:42
q)h:.duckdb.main[]
q)g
42
q)/ the query that autoloads json: an i64 return read before its call would break here
q).duckdb.exec[h;"SELECT typeof('{}'::JSON) AS t"]
| t      |
|        |
|--------|
| "JSON" |
q)t:([] l:1 0N 3; f:1.5 0n 2.25; s:`a`b`c; c:("short";"";"a string well over twelve bytes long"); li:(1 2;`long$();3 4 5))
q).duckdb.set[h;`t;t]; t~.duckdb.get[h;`t]
1b
q)/ 3000 struct/map rows cross the 2048-row chunk both ways
q)st:.duckdb.exec[h;"SELECT {'a': i, 'b': 'n' || repeat('x', (i % 40)::INT)} AS st, MAP {'k': i} AS m FROM range(3000) t(i)"]
q).duckdb.set[h;`st;st]; (count st; st~.duckdb.get[h;`st])
3000
1b
q)/ a DuckDB write lands in q's filesystem
q).duckdb.exec[h;"COPY (SELECT 1 AS x) TO 'w.parquet'"]
| Count |
| long  |
|-------|
| 1     |
q)4#read1 `:w.parquet
0x50415231
